# Camofox API Endpoints Reference

Full OpenAPI spec available at `http://camofox:9377/openapi.json`

## System Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|--------|----------|------|-------------|
| GET | `/` | No | Server status (basic) |
| GET | `/health` | No | Detailed health (tabs, sessions, memory, failures) |
| GET | `/metrics` | No | Prometheus metrics (requires `PROMETHEUS_ENABLED=1`) |
| POST | `/start` | No | Start browser (idempotent) |
| POST | `/stop` | BearerAuth | Stop browser (requires admin key) |
| POST | `/pressure/cleanup` | No | Proactive memory-pressure cleanup |

## Tab Endpoints

### Create Tab
```http
POST /tabs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <api_key>

{
  "userId": "string",
  "sessionKey": "string",
  "url": "string (optional)",
  "trace": "boolean (optional, first tab only)"
}
```
Response: `{"tabId": "uuid", "url": "string"}`

### List Tabs
```http
GET /tabs?userId=string
```
Response: `{"running": true, "tabs": [{"tabId", "targetId", "url", "title", "listItemId"}]}`

### Navigate
```http
POST /tabs/{tabId}/navigate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <api_key>

{
  "userId": "string",
  "url": "string (optional)",
  "macro": "string (optional, e.g. @google_search)",
  "query": "string (optional, for macro)",
  "sessionKey": "string (optional)"
}
```

### Accessibility Snapshot
```http
GET /tabs/{tabId}/snapshot?userId=string&format=text|json&offset=integer&includeScreenshot=true|false
```
Response: `{"url", "snapshot", "refsCount", "truncated", "totalChars", "hasMore", "nextOffset"}`

### Wait for Selector
```http
POST /tabs/{tabId}/wait
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <api_key>

{
  "userId": "string",
  "selector": "string",
  "timeout": "integer (ms)"
}
```

### Click
```http
POST /tabs/{tabId}/click
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <api_key>

{
  "userId": "string",
  "ref": "string (e.g. e3)",
  "selector": "string (fallback)",
  "doubleClick": "boolean",
  "coordinates": {"x": "number", "y": "number"}
}
```

### Type
```http
POST /tabs/{tabId}/type
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <api_key>

{
  "userId": "string",
  "ref": "string",
  "selector": "string",
  "text": "string",
  "clear": "boolean",
  "submit": "boolean"
}
```

### Press Key
```http
POST /tabs/{tabId}/press
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <api_key>

{
  "userId": "string",
  "key": "string (Enter, Escape, Tab, ArrowDown, etc.)"
}
```

### Scroll
```http
POST /tabs/{tabId}/scroll
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <api_key>

{
  "userId": "string",
  "direction": "up|down",
  "amount": "integer (pixels)"
}
```

### Set Viewport
```http
POST /tabs/{tabId}/viewport
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <api_key>

{
  "userId": "string",
  "width": "integer (100-4000)",
  "height": "integer (100-4000)"
}
```

### Navigation Helpers
- `POST /tabs/{tabId}/back` - Go back
- `POST /tabs/{tabId}/forward` - Go forward
- `POST /tabs/{tabId}/refresh` - Refresh page

### Content Extraction
```http
GET /tabs/{tabId}/links?userId=string
GET /tabs/{tabId}/images?userId=string
GET /tabs/{tabId}/downloads?userId=string
GET /tabs/{tabId}/screenshot?userId=string  # Returns base64 PNG
GET /tabs/{tabId}/stats?userId=string      # Tab metadata
```

### Structured Extraction
```http
POST /tabs/{tabId}/extract
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <api_key>

{
  "userId": "string",
  "schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "fieldName": {"type": "string|number|integer|boolean", "x-ref": "e1"}
    },
    "required": ["fieldName"]
  }
}
```

### JavaScript Evaluation
```http
POST /tabs/{tabId}/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <api_key>

{
  "userId": "string",
  "expression": "string (JS expression)"
}
```

### Close Tab
```http
DELETE /tabs/{tabId}?userId=string
```

### Close Tab Group
```http
DELETE /tabs/group/{listItemId}?userId=string
```

## Session Endpoints

### Import Cookies
```http
POST /sessions/{userId}/cookies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <api_key>

{
  "cookies": [
    {
      "name": "string",
      "value": "string",
      "domain": "string",
      "path": "string",
      "expires": "number (unix timestamp)",
      "httpOnly": "boolean",
      "secure": "boolean",
      "sameSite": "Strict|Lax|None"
    }
  ]
}
```
Response: `{"ok": true, "userId": "string", "count": "integer"}`

### Destroy Session
```http
DELETE /sessions/{userId}
```
Response: `{"ok": true, "closed": "integer (tabs closed)"}`

### Traces
```http
GET /sessions/{userId}/traces                    # List trace files
GET /sessions/{userId}/traces/{filename}        # Download trace zip
DELETE /sessions/{userId}/traces/{filename}     # Delete trace
```
Requires BearerAuth.

## Legacy Endpoints (Deprecated)
- `POST /tabs/open` → use `POST /tabs`
- `POST /navigate` → use `POST /tabs/{tabId}/navigate`
- `GET /snapshot` → use `GET /tabs/{tabId}/snapshot`
- `POST /act` → use specific interaction endpoints

## Authentication

| Scheme | Header | Use Case |
|--------|--------|----------|
| BearerAuth | `Authorization: Bearer <CAMOFOX_API_KEY>` | Cookie import, traces, stop |
| AccessKeyAuth | `Authorization: Bearer <CAMOFOX_ACCESS_KEY>` | Superkey - all routes except /health, cookie import, /stop |

## Error Responses

All errors return:
```json
{"error": "string description"}
```

Common status codes:
- 400 - Invalid request (missing fields, bad schema)
- 403 - Forbidden (missing/invalid auth)
- 404 - Tab/session not found
- 409 - Conflict (trace on existing session, page changed during click)
- 429 - Rate limit / tab limit reached
- 500 - Internal server error
- 503 - Unhealthy / recovering